# Unified E2E testing (`y-tst-e2e`)

**Entry point** for **all** ResiRoo and PMRoo end-to-end manual test runs. This rule does **not** duplicate runbook steps — after Q0 it delegates to a path-specific sub-rule.

Final report format: `.cursor/rules/y-rules/insight/y-ins-e2e-report.mdc`.

Skill reference (PMRoo statistical runs): [`.cursor/skills/roo-chat-testing/SKILL.md`](../../../.cursor/skills/roo-chat-testing/SKILL.md).

---

## Mandatory pre-flight — agent type (Q0)

**Do not start any E2E step until Q0 is answered.** Use the **AskQuestion** tool; never substitute free-text guesses.

| Step | ID | When | Prompt | Options |
|------|-----|------|--------|---------|
| Q0 | `e2e_agent_type` | Always (first) | Which E2E flow? | **Resiroo** · **PMRoo** |

---

## Route to sub-rule (after Q0)

**Read and follow the matching sub-rule end-to-end** — including its own pre-flight (Q1–Q6 or Q1–Q5), env setup, ingress, verification, report, and optional post-E2E handoff. Do **not** skip or shorten sub-rule steps.

| Q0 answer | Sub-rule | Scope |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| **Resiroo** | `.cursor/rules/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-resiroo.mdc` | Local / MP Testing · Live APIs / Mock · RabbitMQ / Chat API / SMTP |
| **PMRoo** | `.cursor/rules/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-pmroo.mdc` | Local + mp_mock default · Chat API · `register_pm_requests` · remote MP/n8n opt-in |

**Direct sub-rule invoke:** If the user already named the agent (e.g. “run Resiroo E2E”) or attached only `y-tst-e2e-resiroo` / `y-tst-e2e-pmroo`, skip Q0 and follow that sub-rule.

---

## Sub-rules index

| Rule | When |
|------|------|
| `.cursor/rules/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-resiroo.mdc` | Resident E2E — full runbook after Q0 = Resiroo |
| `.cursor/rules/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-pmroo.mdc` | Property Manager E2E — full runbook after Q0 = PMRoo |
| `.cursor/rules/y-rules/insight/y-ins-e2e-report.mdc` | Final report (both paths) |
| `.cursor/rules/y-generative-search-rules/insight/y-ins-conversation.mdc` | Transcript formatting |
| `.cursor/rules/qa-jira-sync.mdc` | Post results to Jira (optional) |

Path-specific payload, WO, and verification rules are listed inside each sub-rule.

---

## Mixed E2E (future)

Not implemented. Run **Resiroo** and **PMRoo** as separate sessions (Q0 each time, or invoke each sub-rule directly) until a follow-up ticket adds mixed orchestration.
